# HeartOfVolcano (31385), talked to with no Valakas in the world: its first page
# heart_of_volcano001.htm, then the entry answers heart_of_volcano002.htm (global memo key 3
# unset). Expectations are derived from the reference source (HeartOfVolcano.java 33-82). Its
# count of entrants, the teleport to its TelPos, the script event to Valakas, the refusals
# heart_of_volcano003.htm and heart_of_volcano004.htm and its minute timer are in
# tests/ai/boss_valakas_heart_test.go: the format declares no npcmaker of its own type, so it
# places neither the Heart nor Valakas with a spawn_data row.
character Hunter 20
script script.ai.individual.DefaultNpc
script script.ai.boss.valakas.HeartOfVolcano
page script/ai/boss/valakas/HeartOfVolcano/
npc heart 31385 Folk 60 0 0

action heart
action heart
  S ActionFailed
  S NpcHtmlMessage obj=heart item=0 page=script/ai/boss/valakas/HeartOfVolcano/heart_of_volcano001.htm
  S ActionFailed
bypass Quest HeartOfVolcano enter
  S NpcHtmlMessage obj=heart item=0 page=script/ai/boss/valakas/HeartOfVolcano/heart_of_volcano002.htm
  S ActionFailed
